		(descr "RCA (phono) jack, right-angle PCB mount, from the YACC1 Video V1.0 card: centre pin C1 and three shell legs S1-S3. Its body is drawn on F.Fab as on the silkscreen: the block over the pads, 14.2 x 9.1 mm, and the 7.6 mm barrel running 4.3 mm on from it (towards the card edge: the footprint is placed with the barrel's mouth at the edge). The fab-layer body since 2026-11-19 (pcb-check's BODIES line: a part with no body drawn is a part the checks cannot see).")
