		(descr "SUB-D: DE-9 female, right-angle PCB mount (Eagle's F09HP: 2.74 mm pitch, 2.54 mm between the rows, mounting pads 25.04 mm apart). Its body is drawn on F.Fab as the outer line of its silkscreen drawing: the flange and shell across the front, the two bracket blocks with their mounting pads, and the pin field between them, 31.0 x 14.35 mm in all; the footprint is placed with the flange at the card edge and the shell overhanging it. Until 2026-11-19 the fab layer had only the nine pins' tails, 11 x 3.6 mm, which pcb-check took for the whole part (its BODIES line).")
